  "_comment": [
    "Per-title credit detail for the credits wall, keyed by the slug in posters.json.",
    "",
    "format      : 'Film' | 'Television' | 'Commercial'. Drives the filter pills.",
    "disciplines : what Take 3 supplied. Shown under the title. NOT SET HERE YET —",
    "              see src/lib/placeholderDisciplines.ts, which is standing in.",
    "",
    "Both are OPTIONAL per title. A title with no format is offered by no format",
    "pill; a title with no disciplines shows its name alone.",
    "",
    "The formats are the published format of each production, which is public",
    "fact: titles carrying a season number in posters.json, plus each remaining",
    "title classified by what it actually is. A handful are left blank because the",
    "slug is ambiguous or the production is not identifiable with confidence — see",
    "docs/credits-content-gaps.md. Nothing here says anything about what Take 3",
    "supplied; that is a separate field and it is not filled in."
